  "details": "An inconsistency has been observed in some option related to icons. The term 'Show' is consistently used in the following strings:\n\n24341: `Show Earmuffs Icon`\n\n23243: `Show Fallback Icon`\n\nHowever, it is omitted in the following string:\n\n23251: `Gesture Icons`\n\nFurthermore, the strings related to 'Gesture Icons' do not specify where these icons are displayed, unlike the Earmuffs Icon and the Fallback Icon. This inconsistency not only lacks clarity but also results in repetitive phrasing.\n\n**Fallback Icon**\n\n13763: `Fallback icon is disabled, click to enable the Fallback icon on nameplates`\n\n17639: `Fallback icon is enabled, click to disable the Fallback icon on nameplates`\n\n**Earmuffs Icon**\n\n13711: `Earmuffs icon is enabled, click to disable the Earmuffs icon on nameplates `(also an extra whitespace character is present on this one)\n\n13709: `Earmuffs icon is disabled, click to enable the Earmuffs icon on nameplates`\n\n**Gesture Icons**\n\n13797: `Gesture Icons disabled, click to enable` (on HUD)\n\n13799: `Gesture Icons enabled, click to disable` (on HUD)\n\nStandardizing these would not only improve clarity but also eliminate unnecessary repetition in the interface",
